# CLARION CALL: every area but the Crown is generated for each run. Over
# 200 seeds, all fourteen generated areas of all seven regions (2,800 maps):
# every note, every door's landing spot and the gold door's are reachable
# by the ship from where it starts (on the real collision rules), each
# door stands on a level floor with a short walk from its landing spot,
# and in the Cellars a note waits close to the start (elsewhere the notes
# fall where they fall). The cave pieces are all sound. An area holds
# fourteen notes, clock-ring spots, pods, grey landing pads under every
# door's landing spot (and a few more), and its region's own enemies, now
# and then a gold champion among them. The Cellars' first area is small
# (5 by 3 cells, 80 by 36 tiles; the others are 8 by 5, 128 by 60); the
# Cellars have loose stones in their ceilings and insect nests, the
# Icehouse fire jets, the Cloister eyes in its walls.
seed 1
game clarion
wait 10
expect pieces_bad == 0
expect gen_bad200 == 0
cheat area 0 0
wait 2
expect map_w == 80
expect map_h == 36
expect notes_left == 14
expect nrings >= 6
expect count20 >= 1
expect loose >= 4
expect count63 >= 1
expect pads >= 9
cheat area 0 1
wait 2
expect map_w == 128
expect map_h == 60
expect loose >= 7
cheat area 1 1
wait 2
expect world_bad == 0
cheat area 2 0
wait 2
expect count15 >= 1
expect champs >= 1
cheat area 3 1
wait 2
expect count7 >= 1
cheat area 4 0
wait 2
expect count11 >= 1
cheat area 5 0
wait 2
expect count24 >= 3
expect count65 >= 1
expect dark == 1
cheat area 6 1
wait 2
expect count16 >= 1
